  "contract": [
    "Reuse canonical ADT flags: wear byte0, initial-state byte1 and filter count byte2. Init/deinit owners are unchanged. Bypass returns1 without touching data/state; counts at least6 shift5 old words and clamp to5 before appending.",
    "The filter appends the current sample, increments the count, and averages only preceding samples. Sum wraps unsigned32 before unsigned division; it intentionally excludes the newest sample. Direct filter oracle checks this independently, including count/bypass bytes and data aliases.",
    "Executor reads the raw sample twice, filters the first read and uses the second read as the unfiltered original. Difference wraps32 then compares as signed32 against-8000000. On requires unsigned original greater than845f7c; off requires original less than842024. Equal boundaries are excluded.",
    "First-state handling sets the seen byte even without a transition. It then evaluates the live wear byte again, preserving possible second transitions after logging mutations. States other than0/1 are not normalized. Default result word0 is zeroed, but an existing update byte is not silently cleared.",
    "Cache filtered sample, preserve exact conditional logger sampling/order and reload result pointers after logging. Result mask7 and actual popcount3 accompany signed difference and a twice-read frame counter. Reporter accepts any nonzero update byte and only result1/2, clearing the opposite software event then setting10/20 respectively.",
    "Direct native/C execution covers all588 new instruction bytes. Integrated dispatcher replays execute real ADT/filter/report code and actual sleep/popcount/memory/soft-event helpers, covering190 dispatcher bytes and440/94/46 ADT bytes. Only logging and the other four engine bodies are modeled. No source execution may enter stock code."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The10325 pairs are6948 direct cases plus3377 dispatcher cases, some of which gate or fault before reaching ADT. Direct checks cover all588 new bytes; integrated checks cover440 of448 executor bytes. This is not physical sampling or interrupt proof.",
    "Logging callbacks and synthetic helper-entry mutations test exposed-pointer reload timing; they do not prove arbitrary concurrency, private stack aliases or all invalid pointers. Typed byte arguments and signed8 callback results follow their public C ABI.",
    "The28-byte raw/history owners correspond to native existing RAM. Their final executable placement, cold startup and complete firmware memory map remain unverified. No duplicate flags owner is introduced.",
    "All895 units compile and compose without failures or duplicate strong symbols;884 prior nongenerated source/object pairs remain unchanged. ADT import is removed with no added imports: application78 to77; boot22. This remains relocatable composition rather than a bootable image.",
    "HR,HRV,SpO2 and soft ADT executors remain unfinished, along with other hardware/runtime dependencies and final linking/startup. No paid compiler or byte identity is required or claimed."
  ],
